{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a7c3e1d0-6b12-4f08-9c4a-mestizo-t6-api",
    "name": "Mestizo API (T6)",
    "description": "Colección de las rutas reales documentadas en api/README.md y en los controladores Nest. Base: http://localhost:3000 (sin prefijo /api; el prefijo lo pone el proxy de Vite).\n\nRequiere la API levantada con api/.env.example (puerto 3000, Postgres 5433).\nCuentas de semilla: adoptante.ejemplo@local.test y entidad.ejemplo@local.test, clave EjemploLocal123.\n\nNo hay rutas de IoT, recaudo ni pasarela.\nEl contrato HTTP automatizado equivalente está en api/src/contrato.http.test.ts y api/src/animales/animales.api.test.ts (Jest + Supertest). Eso no sustituye esta colección.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
    { "key": "tokenAdoptante", "value": "" },
    { "key": "tokenEntidad", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Salud y catálogo",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /localidades",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('devuelve un arreglo', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/localidades",
            "description": "Catálogo de 19 localidades urbanas. Sin autenticación."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /animales",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('JSON arreglo', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type')).to.include('application/json');",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/animales",
            "description": "Catálogo público. Coincide con el caso CP-20 de la matriz."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/entrar (adoptante piloto)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 201', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('devuelve token y usuario', function () {",
                  "  const cuerpo = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(cuerpo.token).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(cuerpo.usuario.rol).to.eql('adoptante');",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenAdoptante', cuerpo.token);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"correo\": \"adoptante.ejemplo@local.test\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"EjemploLocal123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/entrar",
            "description": "Cookie sid (web) y token en el cuerpo (Flutter). Nest responde 201."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/entrar (entidad piloto)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 201', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('guarda Bearer de entidad', function () {",
                  "  const cuerpo = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(cuerpo.token).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(cuerpo.usuario.rol).to.eql('entidad');",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenEntidad', cuerpo.token);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"correo\": \"entidad.ejemplo@local.test\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"EjemploLocal123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/entrar"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/entrar (clave incorrecta)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 401', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('mensaje genérico', function () {",
                  "  const cuerpo = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(String(cuerpo.message)).to.include('Correo o contraseña incorrectos');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"correo\": \"adoptante.ejemplo@local.test\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"clave-que-no-es\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/entrar",
            "description": "401. El mensaje no revela si el correo existe."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/entrar (correo inválido)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 400', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"correo\": \"no-es-correo\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"x\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/entrar",
            "description": "ValidationPipe + @IsEmail. Coincide con animales.api.test.ts."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /auth/yo (sin sesión)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200, no 401', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/yo",
            "description": "SesionOpcionalGuard: visitante. Cuerpo null. HU-02."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /auth/yo (Bearer adoptante)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('rol adoptante', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().rol).to.eql('adoptante');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdoptante}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/yo",
            "description": "Correr después del login adoptante. Flutter usa este Bearer."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/registro (correo ya existente)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 409', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(409);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Ada López\",\n  \"correo\": \"adoptante.ejemplo@local.test\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"Correcta123\",\n  \"localidadId\": \"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000\",\n  \"rol\": \"adoptante\",\n  \"consentimientoDatos\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/registro",
            "description": "Conflicto si el correo de semilla ya existe. Un registro 201 exige un correo nuevo y un localidadId real de GET /localidades; no se deja un UUID inventado como caso positivo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/registro (sin consentimiento)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 400', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Ada López\",\n  \"correo\": \"ada.postman@mestizo.test\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"Correcta123\",\n  \"localidadId\": \"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000\",\n  \"rol\": \"adoptante\",\n  \"consentimientoDatos\": false\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/registro",
            "description": "RF de consentimiento. No hay INSERT. Coincide con auth.service.test.ts."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "401 y 403",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /animales/mios (sin sesión → 401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 401', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/animales/mios"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /animales/mios (adoptante → 403)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 403', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdoptante}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/animales/mios",
            "description": "RolesGuard: publicar/listar propios es de entidad."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /animales/mios (entidad → 200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('arreglo', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenEntidad}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/animales/mios"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
